## while
Repeats enclosed effects while limit criteria are met or until set iteration count is reached  
while = { limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }  
 while = { count = 3 <effects> }  
Default max of 1000.
**Supported Scopes**: none  

## withdraw
Withdraws a country from a treaty  
scope:treaty = {  
	withdraw = {  
		country = <country>	# must be valid and must be bound by the treaty  
		apply_break_penalties = yes/no	# optional, default no. If yes, break effects and on-actions apply when treaty is in binding time  
	}  
}  
**Supported Scopes**: treaty  

